          "title": "You'll want to know: উপন্যাস",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "উপন্যাস — upônyās — \"a novel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আমি ছুটিতে একটা লম্বা উপন্যাস পড়লাম। āmi chhuṭite ekṭā lômbā upônyās pôṛlām. I read a long novel during the holidays."
            }
          ]
        },
